  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Ever notice how many casinos seem to",
      "start": 0.04,
      "end": 1.683
    },
    {
      "text": "forget one tiny invention,",
      "start": 1.755,
      "end": 3.398
    },
    {
      "text": "the clock?",
      "start": 3.716,
      "end": 4.216
    },
    {
      "text": "That's not exactly an accident.",
      "start": 4.446,
      "end": 5.696
    },
    {
      "text": "Traditional casino design often kept",
      "start": 5.897,
      "end": 7.63
    },
    {
      "text": "clocks and windows scarce, removing",
      "start": 7.701,
      "end": 9.719
    },
    {
      "text": "obvious clues for how long you've been",
      "start": 9.844,
      "end": 11.344
    },
    {
      "text": "inside.",
      "start": 11.38,
      "end": 11.862
    },
    {
      "text": "The lights stay the same, the machines",
      "start": 12.108,
      "end": 13.912
    },
    {
      "text": "keep flashing, and the outside world",
      "start": 13.966,
      "end": 15.913
    },
    {
      "text": "basically disappears. So 20 minutes can",
      "start": 15.965,
      "end": 18.228
    },
    {
      "text": "start feeling a lot like 2 hours.",
      "start": 18.264,
      "end": 20.175
    },
    {
      "text": "But here's the twist. Not every modern",
      "start": 20.42,
      "end": 22.348
    },
    {
      "text": "casino follows this rule.",
      "start": 22.402,
      "end": 23.634
    },
    {
      "text": "Some newer casinos deliberately use",
      "start": 23.964,
      "end": 25.626
    },
    {
      "text": "daylight, open spaces, and even clocks",
      "start": 25.679,
      "end": 28.162
    },
    {
      "text": "because making you comfortable can work",
      "start": 28.216,
      "end": 29.805
    },
    {
      "text": "too.",
      "start": 29.859,
      "end": 30.109
    },
    {
      "text": "So casinos don't literally ban clocks. The",
      "start": 30.384,
      "end": 32.583
    },
    {
      "text": "real trick is simpler. Control what you",
      "start": 32.673,
      "end": 34.435
    },
    {
      "text": "notice, keep you immersed, and make the",
      "start": 34.488,
      "end": 36.438
    },
    {
      "text": "outside world feel very, very far away.",
      "start": 36.492,
      "end": 39.385
    }
  ],
